span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨首饰丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>今天收我们这个片区的快递员又变回了以前那个老鸟。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子在向我描述那个快递员，“就是耳朵上有个耳钉的那个娃。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我说，“噢噢。我知道是哪个了。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>随后，我又问橘子，“你想要戴耳钉吗？”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子说不想。我问他有没有想戴的首饰。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子说：“主要是你对我没有要求！”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这怎么扯到我头上来了？</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子接着说：“你要是对我有要求，我就每天早起跟个花孔雀一样，打扮了向你开屏！！但是你没有要求~我就不折腾了！”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨东甲圈枝狗腩冬后柑宝宝丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>今日接到友人的中秋节礼物：东甲圈枝狗腩冬后柑宝宝。第一次看到组合起来如此奇怪的中文，一眼望过去甚至没有明确get到收到的是什么东西……打开一看是包装讲究的陈皮。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>友人讲柑宝满三年了，陈皮是去年的南坦二冬皮。山里湿气大最好放在密闭的玻璃器皿里面保存。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我检索了一下陈皮的各种功效，我感觉友人寄陈皮给我，多少有点给牛投喂牡丹的感觉。陈皮，我通常拿来焖肉吃……</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨橘母丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>前段时间，橘母接到二姐的电话，大意是说某日，二姐儿子要回云南，他们晚上等他吃饭，他那一日到得晚，结果二姐的婆婆也就是大好儿的奶奶就生气了。她自己端着一碗白饭气鼓鼓地去其他地方吃了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘母转述整个事情时，还在自夸，说：我是很讲道理的婆婆，我就不这样。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>转眼就到了周日，我和橘子上午起得特别晚，11点多才爬起来。橘子喝了咖啡跑去电脑前忙。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我端着咖啡正浏览一下手机消息呢，橘母特意挤到我面前，探手来拿饼干，在我跟前很大声地叹气给我听，橘母说：“我吃块饼干算了。”又说，“也太晚了！干脆就别做早餐了，你直接去做午餐吧！”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我问她：“你不吃早饭？”她表示不吃。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我：好的，我知道了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>随后我给橘子和自己准备了早餐，没有给橘母备餐。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>老太太不要吃早餐，满足她的愿望。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>那一天的午饭还是将近下午三点才做好，橘母饿得前胸贴后背，端着碗猛吃，也不嫌弃说饭盛多了。这之后，我若是起得晚，她再没有舞到我面前，说“不吃早饭”了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨猫丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>去取快递的路上，看见马路对面一只瘦骨嶙峋的花猫高喊着冲入了对面的农家乐店。猫着急的叫声在店里回荡得震天响。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>农家乐女老板在店里说：“马上马上，来了来了。”她端着一碗鱼杂出来，看见我们，苦笑着说，“这是对面那家人养的猫，他们也不喂它吃东西，猫饿得很。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>她走到路对面的铁门口，将那碗鱼杂倒给猫。猫咋咋呼呼地吃着，看起来尤其可怜。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我们叹息着取完包裹回到家里。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>胖胖黑猫哇哇喊着带我去她的零食柜，她要求开一包鸭肉给她。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>猫和猫的命运差别是多么巨大啊。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨环绕立体声丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>早上我还在睡懒觉，橘子已经早早起来了，但我还在继续睡。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>猫把卧室的门推开，直直冲了进来，然后她开始绕着我的床转着圈喊，喵啊啊啊啊~~~这样大喊着转圈，猫像个环绕立体声。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我从床上坐起来，回应了猫一声，猫的叫声立即变成娇羞的“咪嘤~~”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>猫耐心地等我穿好衣服，然后带着我快乐地跑向她的零食柜子，等我给她倒好猫粮挤好猫条。等她吃得差不多，她喊我去洗手台给她接水喝。猫把自己安排得很好。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我给橘子端去咖啡，给他讲猫早上催我起床。橘子嘿嘿笑，说：“猫其实早上很早来找了我，叫得很大声，我感觉猫是想要我去叫你起床。我没去。后面猫可能等不住，自己去叫你起床了。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨排污管里的猫丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>今天的猫滚到了屋后的排污管道里，这个污泥沟的位置比较偏僻，猫有可能是从山坡上滚落进去的，也有可能是被周围的公猫追逐，躲进去的。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子四处找了很久的猫，他喊猫，听见猫在答应他，但就是不见猫出来。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>后来他绕到屋后紧贴着山壁的排污管附近，听见猫在管子旁的掩体里喊。我换上胶鞋，深一脚浅一脚踩过去，把猫从掩体里抱出来。还好猫没有受伤，只是泥脚脏一点，抱回家洗了脚放到猫条和猫粮边上，猫开始大啖猫条。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>今日真是充实的一天啊，早上，我赶手工订单，十点多钟友人来访橘子陪友人喝茶，中午去外面请友人吃饭。友人随后去机场赶去杭州的飞机。下午回来四处找猫，发现猫在污水沟里，捞出猫，洗猫，喂猫。随后又继续赶手工订单。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>猫吃好喝好之后，爬到三楼她的窝里，咚地一声倒头大睡。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>猫表示今天太操劳了，我要休息。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>晚上，网络断了。橘子给负责这个片区的工程师打电话咨询情况，工程师说水寨那边树子倒了，把线压断了，可能要明天才能搞好。所有人都在给唐姓工程师打电话，他十分繁忙。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>半个小时后，唐工又给橘子打电话，说：修好了修好了，我们在现场把线接上了。离谱啊，半夜三更还在外面修线路啊。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我下午的时候，衣服勾到装珠子的盒子，把一盒3mm小珠子打翻在地。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我当时化身为蒙克的呐喊图。蒙克《呐喊》3mm珠子特别版。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>然后我收拾心情吭呲吭呲捡了大半盒珠子回来。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>晚上我跟橘子说我今日打翻一盒珠子，他先是拿镊子帮我把混乱塞在小盒子里的珠子按照颜色重新分了回去，他还蹲在地上帮我把剩余的珠子捡了回来。多么好的人啊~~~橘子帮我重新分珠子的时候还跟我说：这样很解压！</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>晚上九点半，猫睡好出山了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>猫表示，朕饿了，要吃饭。</span></span></p><p><br></p>",
